WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:03.760
Sometimes, the most elusive anomaly in this
world is true love.

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:08.080
The endless carousel of blind dates, the hours
of fruitless swiping on a variety of dating

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:13.760
apps, and the cringe-inducing awkwardness
of bar-hopping can sometimes all be too much

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:14.560
to bear.

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:16.000
But don’t give up just yet!

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.080
If modern dating’s got you down, then we’ve
got the perfect show for you.

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:24.480
It’s time for some matchmaking merriment
the likes of which the world has never seen,

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:27.680
so sit back, relax, and get ready to fall
in love.

00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:32.160
Live from the SCP Foundation, it’s the SCP
Dating Game!

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:37.040
We’ve assembled the Foundation’s most
eligible bachelors, bachelorettes, and entities

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:41.920
of indeterminate gender who are ready to secure,
contain, and protect your heart!

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:46.720
Without further ado, let’s get right to
it and meet our first fabulous contestant.

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:49.680
Meet SCP-096!

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:54.160
If you like the introverted type, then this
Bachelor might just be for you!

00:00:54.160 --> 00:00:56.400
He prefers to keep to himself and spends most&nbsp;

00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:58.960
of his time hiding his face&nbsp;
and crying uncontrollably

00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:00.320
in the corner of his cell.

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:04.080
Isn’t it refreshing to find a guy who’s
so in touch with his emotions?

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:08.320
It might take some work to get him out of
his shell, but if you are patient and kind,

00:01:08.320 --> 00:01:11.440
then you’ll be surprised at what he’s
capable of.

00:01:11.440 --> 00:01:14.800
096 enjoys long walks&nbsp;
through the remote mountains,&nbsp;

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:17.360
sad movies, and being appreciated for what’s

00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:20.000
on the inside rather than what he looks like.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:25.760
Just make sure you honor his boundaries, and
never ever look at his face, and you could

00:01:25.760 --> 00:01:29.280
be the companion this Shy Guy is looking for.

00:01:29.280 --> 00:01:33.040
But maybe you’re looking for someone more
talkative, the kind of person who commands

00:01:33.040 --> 00:01:35.680
the room at a dinner party with an amazing
story.

00:01:35.680 --> 00:01:40.160
If your idea of the perfect partner is someone
who has lived a wild, fascinating, dangerous

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:42.800
life, then you’ll love our next dashing
contestant.

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:48.880
He’s SCP-1867, but you can call him Lord
Theodore Thomas Blackwood.

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:53.440
That’s right, not only is he charming and
bold, but he has a title, too.

00:01:53.440 --> 00:01:57.600
Don’t be fooled by the fact that he’s
a tiny sea slug, Lord Blackwood is a master

00:01:57.600 --> 00:02:02.320
adventurer and hunter, and he has faced some
of the most incredible and deadly things this

00:02:02.320 --> 00:02:04.000
world has to offer!

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:06.800
All he wants is someone to share them with.

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:11.440
If you’re ready to travel across the globe
with a gentleman slug, then get ready to pack

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:14.960
a bag and set off on life’s great adventure
together.

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:18.400
Maybe you prefer your experiences to be more
digital.

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:22.240
No jet-setting for you, you’d rather stay
home and flirt through your phone.

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:26.080
If you’re into the technological side of
love, but are looking for an alternative to

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:30.880
the dreaded dating apps, then this next contestant
could be the one for you.

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:37.520
All you have to do to meet them is download
one free app: MalO ver1.0.0, and you get to

00:02:37.520 --> 00:02:40.080
meet SCP-1471.

00:02:40.640 --> 00:02:45.280
This is one attentive partner, they’ll text
you every few hours, and you’ll get to see

00:02:45.280 --> 00:02:48.160
them everywhere even when they’re not really
there.

00:02:48.160 --> 00:02:52.240
If you’re feeling a bit put off by their
skull face and shadowy body, maybe you should

00:02:52.240 --> 00:02:54.640
work on being a bit less shallow.

00:02:54.640 --> 00:02:58.480
Don’t judge a book by its cover, they just
really want to check-in and see how you’re

00:02:58.480 --> 00:03:01.840
doing, and make sure you never ever feel lonely.

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:05.200
But hey, maybe that’s all a little too much
darkness for you.

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:07.520
Maybe you’re looking for someone sweeter.

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:12.000
Meet SCP-2396, also known as Ms. Sweetie.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:17.040
She’s a lovely lady who’s all about appreciating
the bright side of life, even when things

00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:18.000
get sour.

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:21.120
If you get hungry while on a date with her,
good news!

00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:24.320
She can spontaneously generate her own hard
candy.

00:03:24.320 --> 00:03:28.160
No more paying through the nose for movie
theater concessions, your date’s got the

00:03:28.160 --> 00:03:29.440
snacks covered.

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:33.280
Now be advised, she’s not the fondest of
men, so the fellows out there might want to

00:03:33.280 --> 00:03:38.240
steer clear, but everyone else should try
and see just how sweet life together can be.

00:03:38.240 --> 00:03:41.600
Are you feeling lovesick, and starting to
think there might not be a cure?

00:03:41.600 --> 00:03:46.000
Then you might need a doctor, a Plague Doctor
to be exact.

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:52.080
Our next eligible anomaly is SCP-049, and
not only does he have an impressive career

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:53.760
- I mean, come on, he’s a doctor!

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:58.080
- but he’s also a big believer in working
toward the greater good.

00:03:58.080 --> 00:04:03.200
This dapper, refined Frenchman - so you know
he’s a natural romantic - believes in healing

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:07.920
the world, taking care of others, and making
sure everyone is feeling well.

00:04:07.920 --> 00:04:11.440
If you’re looking for someone to heal your
heart, look no further.

00:04:11.440 --> 00:04:15.040
This beaked bachelor has got the magic touch.

00:04:15.040 --> 00:04:20.160
Speaking of impressive resumes, if a doctor
isn’t enough for you, then how about a king?

00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:24.480
That’s right, the Scarlet King himself is
our next contestant.

00:04:24.480 --> 00:04:29.920
This hunk of burning hatred is tall, dark,
and unknowable by our tiny mortal minds.

00:04:29.920 --> 00:04:34.000
If you’re attracted to power, influence,
and unbridled evil, and don’t mind that

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:38.320
he’s got a few children already, then you
can take the throne by his side and reign

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:40.160
over chaos together.

00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:45.280
Some people look for a partner that’s powerful
and intimidating, but others prefer an everyman.

00:04:45.280 --> 00:04:52.160
SCP-507 is a friendly, average guy, who just
happens to be extremely well-traveled.

00:04:52.160 --> 00:04:56.000
We’re not talking about a semester abroad
in Europe, this guy’s travel history is

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:58.160
completely out of this world.

00:04:58.160 --> 00:05:02.320
He’s not afraid to be spontaneous, in fact,
he can’t stop himself from taking a trip

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:03.120
at a moment’s notice!

00:05:04.880 --> 00:05:08.960
So if you’re the kind of person who’s
always looking for your next weird, wild,

00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:14.000
exotic getaway, then 507 might be your perfect
match.

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:17.440
You’ve got to be willing to roll with some
weirdness though, because some of the trips

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:23.920
507 takes include extreme temperatures, bizarre
landscapes, and an ominous Smiling Man.

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:28.000
But think of the memories you’ll share that
will only bring you and your dimension-hopping

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:30.080
beau even closer together!

00:05:30.080 --> 00:05:31.840
Would you like to take a walk on the wild
side?

00:05:31.840 --> 00:05:38.640
If so, you’re in luck, because our next
Bachelorette, SCP-953, is a real fox.

00:05:38.640 --> 00:05:40.400
No seriously, she’s a fox.

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:44.400
She’s highly adaptable, capable of shapeshifting,
and she loves to cook!

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:47.840
Her favorite dish is liver, though she prefers
to eat it raw.

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:52.400
She’s an elegant, charismatic lady with
an appreciation for the finer things in life

00:05:52.400 --> 00:05:56.960
like plum wine, so why not join her for a
drink and just see where it goes?

00:05:56.960 --> 00:06:01.600
Just be polite, don’t call her a kitsune,
and make sure your date isn’t anywhere near

00:06:01.600 --> 00:06:02.880
a dog park.

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:07.280
This next eligible bachelorette is a great
fit for anyone who doesn’t place a high

00:06:07.280 --> 00:06:08.320
value on looks.

00:06:08.320 --> 00:06:12.480
That’s not to say she’s unattractive,
but you won’t be able to look at her.

00:06:12.480 --> 00:06:19.680
It’s SCP-347, or Claudia, and she just so
happens to be completely invisible.

00:06:19.680 --> 00:06:24.560
Claudia has a great sense of humor, a love
of pranks, and a variety of talents including

00:06:24.560 --> 00:06:25.520
lock picking.

00:06:25.520 --> 00:06:29.680
With her talent for theft, you won’t have
to worry about being the sole breadwinner!

00:06:29.680 --> 00:06:34.720
She’s a great gal to come home to if you’re
sick of spending time alone in an empty apartment,

00:06:34.720 --> 00:06:37.520
but still want your apartment to look like
it’s empty.

00:06:37.520 --> 00:06:42.160
Just make sure you give any houseguests a
heads up before they come over that your home

00:06:42.160 --> 00:06:45.680
isn’t haunted, you just have an invisible
girlfriend!

00:06:45.680 --> 00:06:46.960
Do you like an older man?

00:06:46.960 --> 00:06:50.000
How about a man as old as the universe itself?

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:54.880
Great news, here comes SCP-343, also known
as God.

00:06:54.880 --> 00:07:00.000
This good-natured silver fox is massively
powerful and apparently omnipotent.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:03.520
He knows absolutely everything about everything.

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:07.040
You wouldn’t be able to keep any secrets
from him, but think of how you’d wipe the

00:07:07.040 --> 00:07:09.360
floor with everyone at bar trivia!

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:13.840
And up next, we have SCP-2430 - The Immortal
Hitler Clone!

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:15.600
Just kidding.

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:16.800
Can you even imagine?

00:07:16.800 --> 00:07:18.160
Even we wouldn’t stoop that low.

00:07:18.800 --> 00:07:19.600
Moving on!

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:21.120
Do you like the bad boy type?

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:22.160
A misanthrope?

00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:26.160
Someone you can bond with over your shared
hatred of, well, everything?

00:07:26.160 --> 00:07:30.400
You sound like kind of a bummer, to be honest,
but there’s an SCP match that suits you

00:07:30.400 --> 00:07:31.440
perfectly.

00:07:31.440 --> 00:07:35.840
SCP-682 would absolutely love to hate with
you.

00:07:35.840 --> 00:07:40.960
This massive, extremely intelligent reptile
is one rude dude with a bad attitude.

00:07:40.960 --> 00:07:46.880
682 is also ready for anything that life could
throw at it, capable of adapting to any situation.

00:07:46.880 --> 00:07:50.960
Sure, this creature wants to destroy every
living thing in its path, and seems unwilling

00:07:50.960 --> 00:07:53.440
to stop until the entire&nbsp;
world has been eradicated,&nbsp;

00:07:53.440 --> 00:07:55.840
but come on…you can change him.

00:07:55.840 --> 00:08:01.920
If you’re into Boston accents, then pay
close attention to our next entry: SCP-527,

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:05.520
a fancy little gentleman by the name of Mr.
Fish.

00:08:05.520 --> 00:08:06.960
Why is he called Mr. Fish?

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:07.920
I mean, come on.

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:08.560
Look at him.

00:08:08.560 --> 00:08:10.000
He’s a guy with a fish head.

00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:13.840
He can’t breathe underwater, or talk to
other fish, or do anything unusual at all

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:14.400
really!

00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:17.200
He’s just a guy from Boston, looking for
love.

00:08:17.200 --> 00:08:21.680
He just so happens to have the head of a fish,
with a teeny little top hat.

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:27.200
He’s ready for any formal occasion you might
need someone to accompany you to: a wedding,

00:08:27.200 --> 00:08:29.440
the opera, your nephew’s bar mitzvah.

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:33.440
But hey, if he’s not your pick, there are
plenty of fish in the sea.

00:08:36.560 --> 00:08:40.320
Speaking of the sea, our next contestant is
one tall drink of water.

00:08:40.320 --> 00:08:46.640
SCP-054, the water nymph, is a shapeshifting
creature made up entirely of ordinary water

00:08:46.640 --> 00:08:50.080
that just so happens to take on the shape
of a humanoid woman.

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:54.320
She’d love to go swimming with you, have
a fun day at a waterpark, or play a game of

00:08:54.320 --> 00:08:56.000
shapeshifting charades.

00:08:56.000 --> 00:09:00.320
If that sounds like a wave you’d like to
catch, throw on a swimsuit and get ready to

00:09:00.320 --> 00:09:03.920
dive into a future with SCP-054.

00:09:03.920 --> 00:09:07.520
Your body is mostly water, so you two already
have a lot in common!

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:12.320
It's really important to have shared interests
in a romantic partnership, and if you consider

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:15.600
yourself a foodie, then this next contestant
is for you!

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:19.280
Meet SCP-082, Fernand.

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:21.120
Hailing from France - ooh la la!

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:24.400
- Fernand speaks fluent French and English.

00:09:24.400 --> 00:09:29.440
He’s always smiling the same enormous smile,
no matter what life throws at him.

00:09:29.440 --> 00:09:35.680
He’s tall, too, standing at approximately
8 feet, and weighing around 700 pounds.

00:09:35.680 --> 00:09:37.920
There’s just so much of him to love!

00:09:37.920 --> 00:09:41.840
This guy loves to cook just as much as he
loves to eat, though he’s probably not a

00:09:41.840 --> 00:09:43.840
great fit for a vegetarian.

00:09:43.840 --> 00:09:45.600
He loves his meat.

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:51.040
He also has a passion for fashion and culture,
enjoying fine clothing, television and films,

00:09:51.040 --> 00:09:53.760
novels, and singing classical music.

00:09:53.760 --> 00:09:59.760
This is a man with exceptional taste, and
a hunger for all of the finest things in life.

00:09:59.760 --> 00:10:04.320
If refined gentlemen interest you, but you’re
not sure about someone with such a voracious

00:10:04.320 --> 00:10:08.160
appetite, then this next contestant is more
your speed.

00:10:08.160 --> 00:10:10.720
Especially if you’re a bit of an Anglophile.

00:10:10.720 --> 00:10:15.920
Mr. Deeds can be summoned via SCP-662, or
the butler’s handbell.

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:20.080
If you ring it, he’ll appear, ready to attend
to your every need.

00:10:20.080 --> 00:10:26.000
A proper English butler, Mr. Deeds is a generous
partner intent on keeping others satisfied.

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:30.720
He’s an especially good fit for someone
busy who needs a little help around the house.

00:10:30.720 --> 00:10:35.440
Mr. Deeds is the perfect househusband, ready
to greet you at the door with a hot meal and

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:38.320
listen to you talk about your long day at
the office.

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:41.120
Just don’t be afraid to ask for what you
need from him!

00:10:41.120 --> 00:10:43.680
He can’t help you if you don’t ask.

00:10:43.680 --> 00:10:47.520
The next contestant with us today has got
some killer hair.

00:10:47.520 --> 00:10:51.600
SCP-352, Baba Yaga, has so much going for
her.

00:10:51.600 --> 00:10:56.400
She’s got maturity, knowledge, superhuman
healing abilities, and a bite that causes

00:10:56.400 --> 00:10:58.720
the nervous system to shut down.

00:10:58.720 --> 00:11:03.120
Her hobbies include cannibalism, long strolls
through the Enchanted Forest, and crafting

00:11:03.120 --> 00:11:05.200
web-like traps out of her hair.

00:11:05.200 --> 00:11:09.920
She’s lived long enough to know exactly
what she wants, and maybe what she wants is

00:11:09.920 --> 00:11:10.640
you!

00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:15.040
If you happen to speak Old Russian, and have
a taste for human flesh, then the two of you

00:11:15.040 --> 00:11:19.520
can play house together in a lovely forest
cottage on top of some chicken legs and abduct

00:11:19.520 --> 00:11:23.120
any unwitting travelers that wander into your
midst.

00:11:23.120 --> 00:11:27.680
You know what they say: the couple that preys
together, stays together.

00:11:27.680 --> 00:11:32.080
If you love an older paramour, but you’re
looking for someone with a bit more masculine

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:35.920
energy, then our next Bachelor is the perfect
pick.

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:42.000
SCP-106, or the Old Man, has traveled all
the way from his pocket dimension lair to

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:44.720
hunt for one thing: someone to love.

00:11:45.360 --> 00:11:49.120
His appearance might be startling at first,
but if you give him a chance to get close

00:11:49.120 --> 00:11:52.640
to you, he’s guaranteed to melt your heart.

00:11:52.640 --> 00:11:56.880
This next fellow has taken some time off from
his busy professional life to come here and

00:11:56.880 --> 00:11:59.600
compete for someone special to call his own.

00:11:59.600 --> 00:12:04.960
He’s a career man, dedicated to his job,
but he’s also got room in his life for romance.

00:12:04.960 --> 00:12:09.120
It’s SCP-1879, the indoor salesman!

00:12:09.120 --> 00:12:13.600
He’s an ambitious guy with a passion for
sales, and doesn’t like to take no for an

00:12:13.600 --> 00:12:14.240
answer.

00:12:14.240 --> 00:12:19.200
His hobbies include sales, sales, and more
sales, in addition to appearing inside your

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:23.360
home when you least expect it, driving a hard
bargain, and smooth talk.

00:12:23.360 --> 00:12:28.240
He’s a slick charmer who’s promising the
deal of a lifetime on a one-of-a-kind product:

00:12:28.240 --> 00:12:29.360
his heart.

00:12:29.360 --> 00:12:34.400
Maybe you don’t want a businessman, maybe
you want a guy whose career is a bit more

00:12:34.400 --> 00:12:35.440
whimsical.

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:40.080
Someone with an artistic side, a sense of
humor, someone who can clown around from time

00:12:40.080 --> 00:12:40.880
to time.

00:12:40.880 --> 00:12:44.560
Well, you ought to meet SCP-2094, Motormouth.

00:12:44.560 --> 00:12:50.400
He’s a multi-talented guy, skilled at juggling,
gymnastics, and acrobatics, and stretching

00:12:50.400 --> 00:12:55.360
his lower jaw up to 2 meters in any direction
to engulf just about any item.

00:12:55.360 --> 00:13:00.640
Never pay for storage space again, Motormouth
can store anything you need him to in his

00:13:00.640 --> 00:13:03.120
extradimensional second stomach!

00:13:03.120 --> 00:13:05.280
You’ll never be bored again, that’s a
guarantee.

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:08.640
If looks are more important&nbsp;
to you than personality,&nbsp;

00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:11.600
like way more important, then feast your eyes

00:13:11.600 --> 00:13:13.200
on our next competitor.

00:13:13.200 --> 00:13:16.800
It’s SCP-056, A Beautiful Person!

00:13:16.800 --> 00:13:17.680
What’s your type?

00:13:17.680 --> 00:13:18.240
Tall?

00:13:18.240 --> 00:13:18.720
Short?

00:13:18.720 --> 00:13:20.240
Blonde, brunette, redhead?

00:13:20.240 --> 00:13:21.120
Bearded or shaven?

00:13:21.120 --> 00:13:22.640
It doesn’t matter!

00:13:22.640 --> 00:13:27.600
No matter what you like, 056 will change its
shape to become appealing to you.

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:32.880
No one knows what this entity’s original
form looks like, but it is always gorgeous

00:13:32.880 --> 00:13:37.360
and it always looks like the most appealing
person an observer can imagine.

00:13:37.360 --> 00:13:39.760
Talk about knowing how to read the room!

00:13:39.760 --> 00:13:44.240
If you have a more dominant personality, then
you should keep looking, because this entity

00:13:44.240 --> 00:13:46.880
likes its partners on the submissive side.

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:51.200
It knows that it is superior to you, and wants
to make sure you know it too.

00:13:51.200 --> 00:13:55.040
But if you’re looking for someone gorgeous
to worship, and don’t mind them being rude

00:13:55.040 --> 00:14:00.000
all the time and knowing more than you about
everything, then you and 056 can make a life

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:02.800
together filled with beauty and disdain.

00:14:02.800 --> 00:14:07.440
For our next contestant, let’s see what’s
behind Door Number Three!

00:14:08.480 --> 00:14:10.560
It’s SCP-303!

00:14:11.600 --> 00:14:15.520
Actually, this contestant is behind every
door, any door, anywhere.

00:14:15.520 --> 00:14:20.320
No matter where you are, if there is a door,
it will appear on the other side.

00:14:20.320 --> 00:14:24.480
You’ll know when it’s there, just listen
for the sound of its wheezing breathing.

00:14:24.480 --> 00:14:28.960
That sound means you’re not alone, and you’ll
never have to be again.

00:14:28.960 --> 00:14:34.080
Don’t be nervous, SCP-303 is more afraid
of you than you are of it.

00:14:34.080 --> 00:14:41.040
Love is all about facing your fears, so open
up the door to your heart and let SCP-303

00:14:41.040 --> 00:14:42.240
come inside.

00:14:42.240 --> 00:14:47.440
Our next eligible bachelor is a little bit
prickly on the outside, but he’s got a soft

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:50.000
heart beneath that spiky exterior.

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:56.080
It’s SCP-2800, Cactusman, here to save the
day and sweep you off your feet!

00:14:56.080 --> 00:15:00.400
His real name is Daniel MacIntyre, and yes,
he’s Scottish.

00:15:00.400 --> 00:15:04.720
Not only does he have the DNA of a saguaro
cactus and the ability to grow spines all

00:15:04.720 --> 00:15:08.480
over his body, he also has a super cute accent.

00:15:08.480 --> 00:15:13.360
He’s able to conserve water as well, using
only 1/3 of the water a normal human being

00:15:13.360 --> 00:15:18.480
would use, so he’s an ideal partner for
the particularly environmentally conscious.

00:15:18.480 --> 00:15:23.520
He may be hot, but his body tolerates extreme
temperatures and keeps him from overheating

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:25.360
or becoming dehydrated!

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:30.480
If you had to be stranded on a desert island,
this is the man you’d want with you.

00:15:30.480 --> 00:15:33.040
This next contestant is a real doll.

00:15:33.040 --> 00:15:38.320
SCP-136 loves to laugh, loves attention, and
is full of surprises!

00:15:38.320 --> 00:15:41.840
Give her a chance and she’s guaranteed to
get your heart rate up.

00:15:41.840 --> 00:15:44.240
Good news, she’s already right behind you!

00:15:44.240 --> 00:15:47.680
Oh wow, this is a special surprise!

00:15:47.680 --> 00:15:52.400
We have with us here the host of another classic
show, Laugh is Fun!

00:15:52.400 --> 00:15:54.800
Also known as SCP-2030!

00:15:54.800 --> 00:16:00.240
Laughy McLaugherson here is a real goofball,
just a silly little prankster, who enjoys

00:16:00.240 --> 00:16:05.840
playing jokes, watching inanimate objects
eat people alive, and making people laugh!

00:16:05.840 --> 00:16:06.400
Laugh!

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:06.640
Laugh!

00:16:06.640 --> 00:16:06.800
Laugh!

00:16:06.800 --> 00:16:07.120
Laugh!

00:16:09.040 --> 00:16:11.440
Sorry, I don’t know what came over me there.

00:16:11.440 --> 00:16:13.200
I wasn’t really myself.

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:14.960
But don’t look away yet!

00:16:14.960 --> 00:16:20.720
This contestant loves constant eye contact,
and wants to keep your undivided attention.

00:16:20.720 --> 00:16:27.840
SCP-173 is a living work of art, a sculpture
to be exact, that can only move when it is

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:29.360
not being observed.

00:16:29.360 --> 00:16:33.840
So, as long as you’re keeping an eye on
173, you’ll never lose it!

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:40.000
Up next is a bit of a local celebrity around
these parts: Dr. Bright!

00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:44.640
His consciousness lives inside of an amulet
and after years of trauma he’s not the best

00:16:44.640 --> 00:16:49.680
at opening up to people, but if you’re okay
with an emotionally long-distance relationship

00:16:49.680 --> 00:16:52.560
you can definitely make things work!

00:16:52.560 --> 00:16:57.280
Our final contestant is looking for someone
who loves to laugh, have fun, and get silly

00:16:57.280 --> 00:16:58.400
once in a while.

00:16:58.400 --> 00:17:00.880
Here comes the tickle monster!

00:17:00.880 --> 00:17:02.960
It’s SCP-999.

00:17:02.960 --> 00:17:08.720
This gelatinous gem wants nothing more than
to cheer you up, give you a big hug, and make

00:17:08.720 --> 00:17:11.120
sure you’re having a wonderful day.

00:17:11.120 --> 00:17:16.640
999 has a world of love to share, and simply
coming into contact with its slimy surface

00:17:16.640 --> 00:17:18.640
is enough to make you smile.

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:24.080
Not only does 999 help people feel better,
but it smells good to everyone who meets it,

00:17:24.080 --> 00:17:27.360
bringing a comforting aroma to your shared
home.

00:17:27.360 --> 00:17:31.200
You don’t have to worry about cooking for
it, either, as its diet consists entirely

00:17:31.200 --> 00:17:32.080
of candy.

00:17:32.080 --> 00:17:38.000
Every day is a new chance to laugh and play
with SCP-999, if it tickles your fancy!

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:42.160
And heck, if you’re so eager to hang out
with SCP-999 that you don’t even want to

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:49.440
wait for a date, you can always go to scpswag.com
and get yourself a high-quality SCP-999 plushie!

00:17:49.440 --> 00:17:50.640
Just saying!

00:17:50.640 --> 00:17:52.960
So, who’s your lucky date going to be?

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:55.760
Do you want to play it safe, or take a walk
on the wild side?

00:17:55.760 --> 00:18:01.840
Take a weekend trip with SCP-507, or try to
convince SCP-682 that you’re the only human

00:18:01.840 --> 00:18:04.320
out there who isn’t “disssgussting?”

00:18:05.280 --> 00:18:10.240
Let us know your pick in the comments below
and let your love story finally begin.

00:18:10.240 --> 00:18:17.600
And then go check out “SCP-2521 ●●|●●●●●|●●|● and
Infohazard SCPs Explained” and “SCP-999

00:18:17.600 --> 00:18:18.640
Tickle Monster VS.

00:18:18.640 --> 00:18:24.400
the Most Evil SCPs” for more of our delightful
and terrifying SCP compilations!

